{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>העיני</b> — Two times in the Masorah: העיני האנשים ההם and the other: העיני בשר לך. This teaches that Dathan and Abiram hurled words upward, but the Shechinah was upon them. According to the plain sense: העיני האנשים ההם תנקר — you want to make us blind, eyes for us — for you already said to bring us to a land flowing with milk and honey, and now you say to kill us in the wilderness."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:20.455958832Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}